<Item XName="READ_ME" UserName="READ_ME" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=6 face=Arial&gt;RF_Radar&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue Template Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;This workspace demonstrates how to use SystemVue and SystemVue Engine to add RF impairments to&amp;nbsp;Radar channel&amp;nbsp;in MATLAB and have that signal available back in MATLAB to do further processing.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;Make sure you add the folder &amp;lt;SystemVue Installation Dir&amp;gt;\Baseband_Link to your MATLAB search path.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;Copy this workspace and the MATLAB scripts (RF_Radar.m) located in the same folder as this workspace to a directory where you have write access to.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;There is 3 designs in the the workspace, the designs&amp;nbsp;are &lt;EM&gt;TxChannel,&lt;/EM&gt; &lt;EM&gt;RxChannel and RxChannel+SignalProcessing. &lt;/EM&gt;The&lt;EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;RxChannel+SignalProcessing &lt;/EM&gt;have build-in model &lt;EM&gt;RADAR_PulseCompression &lt;/EM&gt;and &lt;EM&gt;RADAR_MTD&lt;/EM&gt; campared with &lt;EM&gt;RxChannel.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=6&gt;Exercises/Experiments for design &lt;EM&gt;RF_Radar&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;OL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;Open the script RF_Radar.m in MATLAB and read the code and&amp;nbsp;comments to understand the flow.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;Run the script. The first time you run the script, SystemVue Engine starts and there is some&amp;nbsp;one-time initialization delay. Next time you run the script it should run faster.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;In the matlab, the simulation process is 1. Specify parameters -&amp;gt;2.Run the &lt;EM&gt;TxChannel&lt;/EM&gt; analysis and generate the transmitting signal -&amp;gt;3. Plot the Tx channel waveform and spectum on&amp;nbsp;different nodes -&amp;gt; 4. Generate the target echo in the matlab -&amp;gt; 5. Run the RxChannel analysis and generate the baseband signal -&amp;gt; 6. Plot the Rx channel waveform and spectum on&amp;nbsp;different nodes -&amp;gt; 7. Collect the baseband signal and do the signal processing, complete pulse compression and Doppler processing in matlab, and plot the Range-Velocity map.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;In Step 5, if we specify the parameter&amp;nbsp;&lt;FONT color=#ff0000&gt;&lt;EM&gt;NameOfRxAnalysis = &apos;RxChannelSignalProcessingAnalysis&apos;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;, in the step 7, pulse compression and Doppler processing will be done using radar library built-in model.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;/OL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;</Text>
